---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Badge from '../../components/ui/Badge.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/ui/Icon.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms & Disclaimer | Togh Aman Committee"
  description="Terms of use, legal boundaries, and non-sectarian disclaimers of the Togh Aman Committee."
>
  <section class="page-header">
    <div class="container text-center">
      <Badge variant="gold">Legal Framework & Mandate</Badge>
      <h1 class="page-title">Terms of Use & Legal Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="page-subtitle">
        Operating strictly within the constitutional boundaries of the Islamic Republic of Pakistan.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container legal-container">
      <div class="card legal-card card-gold-accent">
        <h2>1. Non-Law Enforcement Status (Important Disclaimer)</h2>
        <p>
          The Togh Aman Committee is a non-governmental, non-political, and non-sectarian community welfare and peace body. 
          <strong>The Committee does not possess policing powers, judicial authority, or detention faculties.</strong> 
          It does not substitute or supersede the Pakistan Police, the District Judiciary, or any municipal or state agency.
        </p>

        <h2>2. Non-Violence & Lawful Representation</h2>
        <p>
          Under Chapter 11 of the Constitution:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>No member or affiliate of the committee shall ever take the law into their own hands.</li>
          <li>The Committee will never issue threats, utilize physical force, or destroy private or government property.</li>
          <li>All actions, disputes, and community matters are prosecuted solely via peaceful dialogue, documented petitions, and lawful representation before competent administrative authorities.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Strict Prohibition of Public Defamation</h2>
        <p>
          In accordance with the Policy principle of <em>"Proof Instead of Accusation"</em>, the committee platform will never be used for character assassination, rumor mongering, or unverified public naming-and-shaming. 
          Evidence must be verified by the legal council prior to administrative petitioning.
        </p>

        <h2>4. Non-Political & Non-Sectarian Guarantee</h2>
        <p>
          Under Chapter 12 of the Constitution, the Committee is strictly prohibited from affiliating with any political party or sectarian movement. 
          Its name, resources, and website shall never be used for electoral campaigning.
        </p>

        <div class="legal-contact-footer">
          <Icon name="shield" size={20} class="text-gold" />
          <p>
            For legal and constitutional inquiries, contact our Legal Council via Secretariat: <a href="tel:923339768022">+92 333 9768022</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-header {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-surface-subtle) 0%, var(--color-background) 100%);
    padding: var(--space-12) 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .page-title {
    margin-top: var(--space-3);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-2);
  }

  .page-subtitle {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .legal-container {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .legal-card {
    padding: var(--space-8);
  }

  .legal-card h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-xl);
    color: var(--color-primary);
    margin-top: var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-3);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .legal-card h2:first-child {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .legal-card p {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-text);
    line-height: var(--leading-relaxed);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .legal-card ul {
    margin-left: var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: var(--space-2);
  }

  .legal-card li {
    font-size: var(--text-base);
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    line-height: var(--leading-normal);
  }

  .legal-contact-footer {
    margin-top: var(--space-8);
    padding: var(--space-4);
    background: var(--color-surface-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: var(--space-3);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-gold);
  }

  .legal-contact-footer p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-sm);
  }

  .text-center { text-align: center; }
  .text-gold { color: var(--color-gold); }
</style>
